{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109677346382872576"]}, "author_id": "3051747481", "created_at": "2026-10-12T16:07:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109677348614250648"], "id": "2109677348614250648", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Ekdalia Evergreen Durga Puja 2026 🚆  Ballygunge Station থেকে কীভাবে যাবেন? | Complete Route Guide https://t.co/oxDTQFBWCE https://t.co/gaTDBcxT3S", "url": "https://x.com/responsivelp/status/2109677348614250648"}, {"author_id": "3051747481", "created_at": "2026-10-12T16:07:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109677251059204313"], "id": "2109677251059204313", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Ekdalia Evergreen Durga Puja 2026 🚆 Ballygunge Station থেকে কীভাবে যাবেন? | Complete Route Guide - YouTube https://t.co/zhgTIyoLd4", "url": "https://x.com/responsivelp/status/2109677251059204313"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109553538590445568"]}, "author_id": "772693965627797504", "created_at": "2026-10-12T07:55:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109553548271014290"], "id": "2109553548271014290", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 195, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Maddox Square &amp; Mudiali carry two very different neighbourhood rhythms, one shaped by Pujo, old homes &amp; familiar cultural landmarks; the other by Feluda memories, Menoka Cinema and the calm of Rabindra Sarobar. What’s your #AmarParaHiddenGems? Share it at https://t.co/VoWlgi6bjf https://t.co/3FKGSiLHu4", "url": "https://x.com/TOIKolkata/status/2109553548271014290"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109527758665854976", "3_2109527771450134528"]}, "author_id": "2084548793731895296", "created_at": "2026-10-12T06:13:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids":